		""
		"I would &acheck&r the &5insanium&r block recipe if you want a &6cheaper&r version and from this point, you can make &bimperium&r seeds and bees, making this progress &ccheaper&r!"
	]
	quest.15D3EA775A53D557.quest_subtitle: "第6阶段"
	quest.15D3EA775A53D557.title: "&5Insanium&r 精华"
