		""
		"可用于具有&d工厂&r版本的&6机器&r"
	]
	quest.4D3922AE72FBECC7.quest_subtitle: "EV 已解锁，全功率运行"
	quest.4D3F2DA049C32098.quest_desc: [
		"You are &lnot&r allowed to use these quests in any public pack without &4&nexplicit permission&r from Catalyst Studios."
		""
		"&4EvilCraft&r questline made by: &aRadz&7Ratz&r"
