	]
	quest.5A7AC88F7D638EF5.quest_desc: ["&#B0BEC5Crafting item&r for other tiers capacitors, &#81C784basic battery&r and &#FFD54Fbasic reactor&r"]
	quest.5A83782E4EB80DB5.quest_desc: [
		"《精神向导》既是知识的守护者，也是将灵魂束缚于你的束缚书中的工具。"
		""
