	quest.7D5439BA46732CEB.title: "万物的核心 (The Core for Everything)"
	quest.7D5CAE3AB604B96B.quest_desc: [
		"We are right now &adone&r with half of Ars Nouveau progress, yes, really."
		""
		"制作一些&#00FFFF基座&r和这2个方块。将&e物品&r放在基座上，最后把主&e物品&r放在&5装置&r上等待。"
